# .publish-manifest — files and folders snapshot-published to the public meta-team repo.
#
# One path, glob, or directory per line. # starts a comment. Blank lines ignored.
# Paths are relative to the private repo root.
# A directory ending in / publishes all its contents recursively.
#
# Workflow:
#   1. Add lines for files/folders you want exposed publicly.
#   2. Run ./scripts/publish.sh from the private repo root.
#   3. The script clears the public worktree and re-snapshots from the manifest,
#      so removing a line here will remove the file from the public repo on the next publish.

